# Wave W17-Y (Route 214): verge pine — a meadow pine in fresh greens, full-crowned for a pine, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on verge turf (ground baked in). Route 214’s own tree — split from the Vernal Path’s blossom elm beside it by form entire (conifer meadow vs flowering lane) and from Route 213’s salt pine by air: meadow wind here, salt wind there.
